/Author (Daniel T. Murphy) /CreationDate (D:20260724033153-04'00') /Creator (\(unspecified\)) /Keywords () /ModDate (D:20260724033153-04'00') /Producer (ReportLab PDF Library - \(opensource\)) 
  /Subject (UQFF whitepaper: PAPER_2029_ROUND_163_SEPTET_BACKBONE_FIRST_UQFF) /Title (Round 163 Septet Discovery \(Backbone-First\): \(1\) delta_rho/rho\(SGR1745\) = F_TRZ 4TH-Instance Completing 4-Object PAPER_1991 F_TRZ^n Perturbation-Ratio Ladder n=1 Rung Family \(Magnetar+Crab+M16+SGR1745\); \(2\) delta_rho\(SGR1745\) = SO_5^16 kg/m^3 EXACT NEW Positive-Exponent Density Slot n=+16 \(Adds Between SO_5^17 Nuclear and Lower Positive Rungs\); \(3\) B\(NGC 6302\) = SO_5^-7 T EXACT NEW Negative-Exponent Magnetic-Field Slot n=-7 Fills Gap in 4-Rung Negative Magnetic Ladder Between n=-5 and n=-8; \(4\) B_crit\(NGC 6302\) = SO_5^-6 T EXACT NEW Negative-Exponent Magnetic-Field Slot n=-6 Adjacent to n=-5 M16 Rung; \(5\) SCm\(NGC 6302\) = 1 - F_TRZ = 9/10 = 0.9 EXACT NEW Dimensional-Domain Extension of PAPER_1922 9/10 = 1 - F_TRZ Ubiquity into Superconductor-Fraction Domain; \(6\) delta_rho_ratio\(Orion\) = F_TRZ^5 EXACT NEW 2ND-Instance of PAPER_1991 F_TRZ^5 Magnetar Burst Perturbation-Ratio at n=5 Rung Completing 2-Object Family; \(7\) M\(Orion\) = 2*SO_5^33 kg EXACT NEW 3RD Rung in 2*SO_5^n Mass Ladder \(Prior n=34 Lagoon PAPER_2027 + n=41 SpiralGalaxy PAPER_2024, Now n=33 Orion Completes 3-Rung Mass Ladder Within 2*SO_5^n Family\); Plus 1 CROSS-OBJECT WITHDRAWAL f_diff\(NGC 6302\) = SO_5^10 Hz = PAPER_1990 Seminal 10 GHz Microwave-Band Anchor) /Trapped /False
>>
